{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "EasyFAB Auth IPC v1",
  "$defs": {
    "choice": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "name"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "session": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "name",
        "role",
        "must_change_password"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "role": {
          "enum": [
            "admin",
            "supervisor",
            "engineer"
          ]
        },
        "must_change_password": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      }
    },
    "new_user": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "id",
        "name",
        "role"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}$"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 100
        },
        "role": {
          "enum": [
            "engineer",
            "supervisor"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "directory_user": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "id",
        "name",
        "role",
        "status"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "role": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "admin",
            "supervisor",
            "engineer"
          ]
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "active",
            "inactive"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "login_directory": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "users",
        "requires_admin"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "users": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/choice"
          }
        },
        "requires_admin": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "description": "list_login_users -> login_directory; login(userId,pin) -> session; logout -> null. Sesion autoritativa en memoria Rust; nunca aceptar roles desde UI. change_password(newPin) -> null, termina sesion; reset_password(userId) -> temporal de 24h, solo admin normal. Revision firmada revoca credenciales anteriores. list_users -> directory_user[]; create_user(input:new_user) -> temporary string of 8 chars; set_user_active(userId,active) -> temporary string on activation, null on deactivation. All require a revalidated normal admin session; admin status is protected. Authentication and new users are independent of Windows identity. Profiles are partitioned by EasyFAB id. Temporary credential signatures cover [id,password_hash,credential_revision,temporary_expires_at]. provision_initial_admin(id,name) -> temporary string; only while team.members is empty, no authenticated session, creates local trust explicitly and requires password change."
}
